":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"nearestNeighborTour","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Cycle","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Walks5CycleV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Walks\/documentation\/Walks\/Cycle"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdditiveArithmetic","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Comparable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tours read the simple graph: self-loops are ignored, and each pair of vertices is joined by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its lightest edge (the earliest position on ties), which is the edge the returned "},{"code":"Cycle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"uses, so "},{"code":"cycle.weight(weight)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the tour’s length. nil below three vertices, before any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other check. "},{"code":"weight","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is called once per non-loop edge, in position order, before any work."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No approximation guarantee in general; within ½(⌈log₂ n⌉ + 1) of the shortest tour when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the weights satisfy the triangle inequality (Rosenkrantz, Stearns and Lewis, “An analysis"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of several heuristics for the traveling salesman problem”, SIAM Journal on Computing 6,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"1977)."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The graph is complete (every pair of distinct vertices joined); no weight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is NaN or infinite."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Precondition"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(n²) after O(n + m) to read the edges and weights.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The nearest-neighbour tour from the first vertex: repeatedly the nearest unvisited vertex,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order on ties, then back to the start."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/nearestNeighborTour(weight:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours","doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"references":{"doc://Tours/documentation/Tours":{"role":"collection","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/tours","identifier":"doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"Tours"},"doc://Tours/documentation/Tours/GraphProtocols/Graph/nearestNeighborTour(weight:)":{"title":"nearestNeighborTour(weight:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/tours\/graphprotocols\/graph\/nearestneighbortour(weight:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"nearestNeighborTour"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"weight"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Cycle","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Walks5CycleV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14Gr